&lt;p&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot;&gt; candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech stack: Google Cloud Platform, Kubernetes, Terraform, Dagster, BigQuery, dbt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click here:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;France&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a hybrid position from our Paris office. Please submit your CV in English.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Global Markets Strategic Finance &amp;amp; Analytics team provides budget oversight, reporting, strategic planning and analytical decision making support to the Global Markets team and in-region business teams across EMEA. In addition this team supports identifying and pursuing opportunities to drive growth and business impact for our international business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;While your formal reporting structure is into the Director, Strategic Finance &amp;amp; Analytics, EMEA, on a day-to-day basis you will work closely with the cross-functional team that is based in-region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will directly support Country Managers (and their teams) based around EMEA to drive clear reporting, produce actionable insight, track core KPIs, evaluate investment decisions and work cross-functionally to develop strategies to solve problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The individual is expected to be a strong cross-functional business partner who has a combination of hands-on analytical skills, financial modelling expertise, commercial acumen, and the ability to package their insights into strong narratives appropriate for senior executive consumption. They will be comfortable working in cross functional teams based in EMEA and around the world including Finance &amp;amp; Accounting, Business Operations, Data Science, Marketing, Product and Supply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ideal candidate relishes the opportunity to roll up their sleeves to drive meaningful impact, possess strong stakeholder management skills, and is a self-starter that is comfortable with ambiguity in a fast paced global work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This person will have a high degree of visibility with senior management within the organization, including Country Managers, Regional and Finance Leaders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;A Typical Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with a Country Manager in driving performance management, including development and ongoing analysis of KPIs, creating goals/OKRs and measuring performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of what levers drive growth and efficiency for our business and translating that into investment cases and initiatives to drive business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with the business on annual planning and budgeting, laying out risks and opportunities and debating strategies and capital allocation to maximise growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stepping in to lead EMEA’s monthly business review and speaking to key drivers of variance to goal and potential actions to improve performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modelling and summarising the implications of a regulatory action and potential mitigating actions we could take to minimize business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Joining a call with the Regional Marketing team to discuss changes to channel or country spend and helping bridge local and regional considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digging into the regional impact of a global product feature and identifying relevant regional insights that could point to local optimization opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical deep dives: Conduct deep dives into business trends across EMEA and different segments of the business. Independently lead data extraction, analysis, visualization, and presentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build ad hoc reporting and analysis to help business operations and other cross functional partners understand the drivers of performance for key performance indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of relevant experience. Ideally, you have demonstrated relevant experience in an analytical role such as Strategic Finance, Financial Planning and Analytics (FP&amp;amp;A), Strategy/Management Consulting, Investment Banking or Business Operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in finance, economics, mathematics, accounting, engineering, statistics or other relevant field that demonstrates quantitative orientation; MBA or advanced degree a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superb financial modeling and quantitative analysis skills, SQL experience highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical abilities and able to synthesize complex information. You enjoy absorbing large amounts of data and qualitative insights and can quickly develop a strong narrative that leads to recommendations and builds our understanding of the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Management: The ability to work and influence cross-functionally in a matrixed business environment is a must. You are proactive, great at communicating with different audiences and can bring stakeholders on-board. You seek out and have a track record for driving change and impact in a fluid, unstructured working environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to put together clear, polished, insightful recommendations for peers, managers and senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re very comfortable with financial modeling in Excel, and are willing to gather internal and external data points to help build a comprehensive business case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re someone who possesses grit and finds creative ways to get the job done. You bring high energy and the ability to prioritize and deliver in a fast paced environment while balancing multiple projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant Sector Experience: Experience in B2C technology businesses is preferred, particularly Marketplace/Classifieds/E-Commerce businesses; broader experience in B2B technology, including Fintech and B2B Software will also be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in &lt;strong&gt;English and French&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in travel and hospitality is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€64.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€75.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Store Checkout&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Digital Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Product Designer (IC3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Lille&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timing: ASAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context &amp;amp; project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon’s mission is to bring people together through sport and make wellbeing accessible for all. To align this mission with planet boundaries, Decathlon relies on In-Store teammates who embody the human touchpoint between our brand and our customers. This is exactly where your mission comes in: designing simple, efficient in-store experiences that make our teammates&#39; lives easier, enabling them to be as effective and impactful as possible with our customers. Within an omnichannel context, your mission will be to combine operational excellence with user needs, bridging the gap between operational requirements, business objectives, and technological opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital plays a pivotal role in the quality of the connection built during moments shared between customers and teammates. How? By ensuring every In-Store Decathlonian works in an efficient and adapted environment that seamlessly supports their daily tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this context, we’re looking for a Senior Product Designer to level up our game on our famous In-Store Checkout. Checkout is that highly unique touchpoint for our customers who know our stores well. It offers a wealth of topics to tackle: friction, fluidity, autonomy, but also up-selling, authentication, and loyalty. It is one of our most signature experiences, well known by our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Designer, you will join a cross-functional team (Product, Engineering, Business, etc.) and have the responsibility to design the future of the In-Store checkout, while continuously improving the living experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to design the store checkout of tomorrow? Want to craft a memorable experience that leaves as lasting an impression on our customers as our automatic item detection? Join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer, you will act as a key partner with cross-functional product teams to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;influence and enlighten decisions, whether long-term strategy, quarterly roadmaps or day-to-day tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ensure that we identify and tackle the most relevant opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;explore &amp;amp; de-risk solutions that are desirable… but also viable and feasible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;build long-term impact (outcomes) rather than features (outputs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft / Core skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy - Support an holistic vision of &quot;Personal Buying Experience&quot; domain (omnichannel journeys and ecosystems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem Discovery - Uncover and refine opportunities through qualitative and/or quantitative research / Map &amp;amp; help prioritize product decisions with Opportunity Solution Trees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution Discovery - Explore &amp;amp; co-create multiple solutions / Prototype early, iterate often / Design usable interfaces aligned with our design system and accessibility standards (WCAG)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing - Constantly de-risk the relevance, usability and impact of explored solutions, using the most adapted method (usability tests, A/B tests, surveys, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors / Soft skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence - Work closely and proactively with all expertises (product, business, engineering, etc.) to influence strategies, prioritization and discovery/delivery roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration - Involve your product team and stakeholders throughout your design process, leveraging the right methods and/or storytelling, creating a safe environment for feedbacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design collaboration - Contribute to elevate the design practice, run and/or participate to collaborative design sessions (co-design, design critiques) with your peers across multiple teams (New Business Models, eCommerce, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth mindset - Proactively identify and build on your strengths and improvement areas, turn failures into positive learning lessons (for you and for others)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join the In-Store adventure?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are a few challenges you may tackle if you join the In-Store adventure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance the human bound - Simplifying complexity and leveraging store teams and management, building more and more quality time spaces between our customer and our teammate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve Store efficiency - Empower our teammates on the field, understand their pain-points and provide strong, efficient and scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reinforce the end-to-end, omni experience - Contribute to an high &amp;amp; amazing end-to-end experience for our customer, by designing the best digital experience for our teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the store of tomorrow - Leverage digital to support the store evolution, and design the future of our main touchpoints with the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In-Store might be a perfect match for you if…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to support the teammates, and be at the heart of Decathlon&#39;s ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love collaborating with a wide variety of expertises &amp;amp; stakeholders (your product team, but also people from eCom, Business, Countries, Sports, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to be part of a lovely &amp;amp; united team, always ready to help each other or share good laughs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to play a key role in transforming Decathlon’s stores !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working: 2 days of remote work per week;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work locations: Ability to work from any Decathlon Digital office in Lille, Paris, or Amsterdam;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality gear: Equipment provided in line with your mission and our social commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebooks);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global reach: A local project team within a worldwide network (offering international career opportunities);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill development: Continuous growth and support (diverse projects, technical certifications from year one, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation package: Competitive package (employee profit-sharing, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;About the Position:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Security Engineer to support, automate and continuously improve the secure configuration of our enterprise assets. In this role, you will be the central point of contact for hardening standards, access controls, and the protection of our IT infrastructure against common attack vectors. You will work closely with various teams and locations to implement security requirements in a practical and sustainable way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configuration Standards: Develop, maintain, and harden the security configuration standards for end-user devices, servers, network components, and software (on-prem/SAAS)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity and Access Management: Manage and oversee centralized Identity and Access Management throughout the account and employee lifecycles, including account provisioning, modification, and deprovisioning during onboarding, role changes, and onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance Monitoring &amp;amp; Audits: Conduct recurring control reviews to verify that approved security processes, technical specifications, configurations, account management practices, and access controls are implemented and operating effectively across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security Automation: Automate configuration validation and remediation, and integrate security-baseline checks into infrastructure provisioning and deployment workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: Work closely with various teams and locations to implement and oversee the above security measures in practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Profile:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of expertise in IT security with relevant exposure to configuration and hardening&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of practical experience implementing security frameworks and standards, such as CIS Controls and Benchmarks, NIST guidance, and ISO/IEC 27001&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge and practical experience of hardening operating systems (Windows/Linux/Mac) and network components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with Identity &amp;amp; Access Management concepts (roles, permissions, recertification) Page 2 of 3&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with configuration management or compliance tools&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and strategic thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent working style and initiative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and German would be beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Beneficial skills:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting skills (Python, PowerShell, or Bash)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge with endpoint protection platforms (EDR/XDR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security Monitoring, Investigation, and Threat Detection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating automated configuration, hardening, and compliance checks into infrastructure provisioning and deployment pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any Relevant Certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots SE&lt;/strong&gt; is an international high-tech company based in Munich, Germany with a production site in Kaufbeuren and more than &lt;strong&gt;3500&lt;/strong&gt; employees worldwide. Our mission is to bridge the gap between artificial intelligence and robotics by developing systems that combine state-of-the-art force-moment-sensing and world-leading image-processing technology. This unique combination of technologies allows us to provide user-friendly and affordable robotic solutions that enable intelligent precision assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is made possible by our employees, who bring out the best in each and every day with creativity and enthusiasm. Become part of this team and shape the future of robotics with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diversity and welcome your application regardless of gender and sexual identity, nationality, ethnicity, religion, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic Security is one of the fastest-growing parts of our business, and our customers (including government and public sector organisations) rely on our Security Solution to modernise their SOC, threat detection, and response capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the hands-on delivery of Elastic Security projects (new implementations, migrations, and use-case expansions) from discovery through architecture design and build. Along the way, you&#39;ll develop trusted relationships with senior stakeholders and work closely with our Services, Engineering and Sales teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is a remote-first company, but many of the projects you&#39;ll deliver might require onsite availability, making the role hybrid in practice, varying by project, with travel of up to 60%.&lt;br&gt;Some of these engagements, given the organisations involved, also require national security screening or clearance; eligibility to obtain one in your country of employment is a strong advantage, and Elastic will sponsor the process where required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assess and Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse customer goals, pain points, existing architecture, and threat landscape, translating them into technical requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design Elastic Security solution architectures (SIEM, endpoint, cloud security) that integrate with the customer&#39;s wider security ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on the customer&#39;s security strategy and own the Elastic side of it, aligning recommendations through regular sessions with senior and key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement and Deliver&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead hands-on delivery of Elastic Security projects end-to-end, including greenfield deployments and migrations from legacy SIEM/EDR platforms in mission-critical environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and secure the Elastic platform: cluster architecture, RBAC and role mapping, single sign-on, private connectivity (private links, VPC peering), and hardening for enterprise and government environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and build large-scale data ingestion with Elastic Agent, Beats, and Logstash, normalising data to ECS and integrating sources such as Kafka, Azure Event Hub, and AWS S3&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop security content aligned to the customer&#39;s threat landscape: detection rules, dashboards, and alerting workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive security migrations from competing platforms, applying deep knowledge of Elastic&#39;s capabilities to translate each use case into its best form, whether through feature parity mapping or full redesign&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish detection-as-code practices for customers managing detections programmatically: developing, testing, versioning, and deploying detection content with Python, Git, and CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply and enable Elastic&#39;s Agentic AI capabilities (AI Assistant, Attack Discovery, agent-driven workflows) to accelerate customers&#39; detection and response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow and Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and deliver new security use cases as customers mature their cyber defence journey with Elastic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver engagements on time and within the agreed Statement of Work (SOW) scope, surfacing opportunities for follow-on work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate confidently with stakeholders from SOC engineers up to CISO / C-suite level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Elastic Sales and pre-sales to assess technical risks and shape opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed field insight back to Elastic Engineering, Product Management, and Support to drive feature enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and share knowledge with fellow Elastic consultants across a highly distributed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or assist with demos and proof-of-concepts that showcase the value of the Elastic Stack, and deliver enablement sessions and hands-on workshops that make customer teams self-sufficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring Along&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years&#39; experience as a Consulting Architect, Senior Consultant, or in a senior IT technical leadership role, delivering and executing professional services engagements, ideally in the security domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience deploying Elastic Security or comparable SIEM platforms (e.g., Splunk, MS Sentinel, QRadar, ArcSight) and/or EDR platforms (e.g., CrowdStrike, MS Defender), or at least 2 years as a Security Analyst / Detection Engineer in a threat detection and response role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An architect&#39;s view of the security ecosystem across varied customer environments: SOAR, vulnerability management, penetration testing, ticketing, and security policies, and how they connect in a SOC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting skills, ideally in Python, and exposure to modern delivery practices such as Infrastructure-as-Code and CI/CD are strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Linux and Windows operating systems, and on-prem and/or public cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer advocacy, relationship-building, and communication skills, with the ability to pivot easily between delivery and strategic engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility to obtain national security clearance in your country of employment (screening sponsored by Elastic where required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel and work onsite with customers (up to 60% of the time), combined with comfort working remotely in a highly distributed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in both English (our company-wide operating language) and the local market language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with advanced Elasticsearch operations: cluster architecture, shard management, data ingestion, and data tiering at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with detection-as-code: authoring, testing, and versioning detection content managed in Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience automating deployments and lifecycle management with Python, Terraform, and CI/CD tooling (e.g., GitLab pipelines)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying and operating containerised workloads on Kubernetes, cloud-managed or self-hosted (EKS, AKS, GKE, OpenShift)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Agentic AI and LLM-based security workflows: AI assistants, automated triage, and agent-driven investigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Tier-2/Tier-3 SOC Analyst, Threat Hunter, or DevSecOps Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in large distributed environments or MSSPs, from architecture through deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering enablement sessions, technical workshops, or product training to technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elastic Certified Engineer certification, or security certifications such as GIAC or CISSP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-PF1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity/affirmative action employer committed to diversity, equity, and inclusion. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: ----- style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes encryption software and technology that is subject to U.S. export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Russia, Syria, the Crimea Region of Ukraine, the Donetsk People’s Republic (“DNR”), and the Luhansk People’s Republic (“LNR”). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Senior Value Engineer, you will spearhead AI and data-driven business transformation within the Insurance sector by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Lead and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to orchestrate complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their Operations &amp;amp; Claims Management ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover the real issues by peeling back layers of organizational complexity. Own the Outcome from first discovery through realized ROI for your process areas. Tell the Value Story by crafting powerful executive narratives and leading business value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate powerful executive sponsorship across core business units to champion transformation programs. Co-own change management with customer leaders and design CoE roadmaps that build self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer Global Transformations across complex workstreams. Own and implement AI-driven account planning and AI-assisted project management. Automate executive governance (QBRs, SteerCos) with minimal manual friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI tools for rapid technical outputs while partnering with Applied Value Engineers for deep-dive solution builds. Champion platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strategic expansion roadmap embedding Celonis as a strategic platform to drive adoption. Provide feedback to R&amp;amp;D based on evolving customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience taking ownership of complex workstreams, process areas, and customer relationships in Value Engineering, Consulting, or Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid background in enterprise IT and business software (e.g., SAP, Workday, Salesforce, Oracle). You operate primarily as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI copilots to generate outputs and automations, avoiding heavy manual coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable setting your own direction within an account team. Driven to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, proactively hunting and ideating for highest-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in executing process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise orchestrating multi-region or business unit transformation programs. Expert at mobilizing VP/Director-level sponsorship. Flawless English [and native-level local language] communication with commanding executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Insurance and wider Financial Services market dynamics. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics,&amp;nbsp; comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well-balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place, serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience, without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered more than 25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 380+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;👐 About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Revenue at Alma covers the entire customer lifecycle, from lead generation to churn. It brings together Marketing, Partnerships, Sales and Account Management, representing more than 100 talented professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Revenue Operations plays a key role in helping these teams work together around shared goals, reliable data and efficient processes. The team supports Revenue leaders in improving performance, making better decisions and scaling the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is a permanent contract, based in Paris, with 2 days of remote work per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/basil-lizotte-aa155182&quot;&gt;Basil Lizotte&lt;/a&gt;, and work closely with Revenue teams, the Central Data Team, Ops &amp;amp; Risk, Product and Tech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Business Analyst, Revenue Operations, you will create strategic insights that help Alma&#39;s Revenue teams understand their performance, identify growth opportunities and improve their speed and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work at the intersection of data, business and strategy, turning complex questions into clear recommendations and practical tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Build reliable data foundations for Revenue&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve business-facing data models by combining relevant CRM, revenue and operational data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve and maintain existing models and contribute to reliable end-to-end data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Turn business questions into strategic insights&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse Alma&#39;s target markets, market share, market dynamics and the key drivers behind commercial wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design ad hoc tools and models to help Revenue teams answer tactical business questions and make faster decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Improve performance monitoring and revenue growth&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage dashboards, KPIs and revenue forecasts so teams and leadership can monitor business health and progress against their goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Revenue leaders in setting the right targets, understanding growth dynamics and prioritising their roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Drive data excellence across Revenue&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote data-informed ways of working across Marketing, Partnerships, Sales and Account Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Central Data Team to maintain high standards of data quality and consistency across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧰 You will work with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SQL, Looker, LookML, Claude Code, Python, dbt, BigQuery, GCP, Rudderstack, Segment, Salesforce&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong SQL skills and are comfortable working with large datasets, raw CRM data and revenue-related information, including Salesforce data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building business-facing data models, dashboards, forecasts or performance analyses from the initial question through to clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can define relevant KPIs, assess business impact and communicate complex analysis in a clear and actionable way to different stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have approximately 4 to 7 years of experience in data analysis, business analysis or a similar role, ideally in a fast-growing technology or fintech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with Looker and LookML.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable with Python and modern data tools such as dbt, BigQuery or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked with tracking tools such as Rudderstack or Segment, as well as experimentation methodologies such as A/B testing, significance testing and causal analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are curious about AI-assisted tools and are interested in using tools such as Claude Code in your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧘 Your Alma experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The culture&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, collective intelligence is at the heart of the way we work. We are building an international company in a fast-growing environment, where people are encouraged to take ownership, share ideas and learn from one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform, regular feedback and opportunities to develop your expertise and career path. As Alma continues to grow across Europe, you will have the opportunity to work with colleagues from different teams, countries and areas of expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to building a fair and inclusive workplace. We monitor our gender equality index and remain committed to pay equity, transparency and equal opportunities across the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The role itself&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you join Alma, you will be able to grow and have an impact by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencing strategic decisions across the full Revenue organisation, from lead generation to churn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combining analytical depth, business understanding and direct exposure to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping Revenue teams build a stronger data culture and create more efficient ways of working as Alma scales across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🤑 Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt; based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health insurance&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt; covered by Alma, including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability insurance&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt; covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport&lt;/strong&gt;: partnerships with &lt;strong&gt;Gymlib&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;ClassPass&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;€30/month&lt;/strong&gt; reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maternity/paternity leave&lt;/strong&gt;: salary maintained at 100% during leave, with no seniority requirement. Return to work at a 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD)&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;€544.80/year&lt;/strong&gt;, excluding full-remote contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meal vouchers&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;€10/day&lt;/strong&gt;, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental health&lt;/strong&gt;: free access to the MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid time off&lt;/strong&gt;: 25 days per year, plus additional paid leave granted to employees on executive contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our &lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 weeks of full remote work possible per year&lt;/strong&gt; during the summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🎯 Interview process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video screen with Lydia a Talent Acquisition team member&lt;/strong&gt; to discuss your background, motivation and the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience interview with Basil Lizotte or/and Gaspard Zha&lt;/strong&gt;, lasting 45 minutes, to discuss the role, the team and your experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home assignment and case study&lt;/strong&gt;, lasting 1 hour, with members team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-site team fit interview&lt;/strong&gt;, lasting 30 minutes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-site N+2 interview&lt;/strong&gt; with Antoine de la Rivière, lasting 30 minutes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference check&lt;/strong&gt; with at least two professional references.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work, whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anduril’s Manufacturing team is producing the next generation of Autonomous Underwater Vehicles globally at rate. The NPI team owns product transfer from design to production across the range of Undersea Dominance’s product range from core vehicle platform to specialised mission capabilities spanning mechanical and electrical hardware build to full system integration &amp;amp; test.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the programmatic horsepower behind new product entry across our undersea portfolio where &lt;strong&gt;new design becomes production&lt;/strong&gt;: deciding whether a product definition is ready to enter the factory, and shaping the run-up so that every cross-functional team has the right data, in the right form, with enough lead time to act on it. The right person is comfortable holding a schedule they do not directly control, influencing without authority, and being the person who says “this is not ready” with the evidence to back it. As a growing function, you are comfortable operating where the process is still being defined, and the instinct to standardise what you solve rather than solve it twice. If you thrive in a fast-paced, resource-limited environment where the process does not exist yet, this role is for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end NPI plan and readiness schedule for assigned programs, aligning engineering releases, supply chain execution and production work-ups against a single build date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and assess production readiness of product engineering — completeness at gate entry, manufacturing baseline maturity, and readiness to commit long-lead spend and convening the right functions to resolve readiness gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run cross-functional NPI planning forums that align engineering outputs to production system inputs, escalating issues and managing production starts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align internal Production scope to support readiness — quality plans, inspection instructions, work instructions, tooling and fixturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive gate and Manufacturing Readiness Review (MRR) readiness, including the evidence that each function has done what the gate assumes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Production at the Change Control Board, so change entering the production system is understood against the build schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run DFx reviews that surface manufacturability opportunities early and flow production issues and observations back into design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the function as you run it: publish standardised guidance on what engineering inputs must contain, their expected maturity, format and audience; objective production-readiness checklists; gate-stage DFX criteria and review cadence; and a repeatable method for coordinating multi-site NPI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own factory-to-factory transfer for new production sites, flowing down NPI data as it becomes transferable, so day-1 scope at a receiving site is planned rather than inherited.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve emergent multi-site NPI issues — design-versus-production jurisdiction, supply chain alternates, localisation questions and escalate with a recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track risks, issues and actions with clear mitigation and escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Science in Mechanical, Manufacturing, Mechatronic, Industrial or Process Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a manufacturing environment, including direct involvement in New Product Introduction or design-to-production transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of a product moving from engineering definition into a production environment, against a committed date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programme and schedule management skills, with a proven ability to drive complex cross-functional work to a deadline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical credibility to interrogate an engineering release — drawings, BOMs, configuration and change records — and form an independent view on whether it is production-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of manufacturing and quality systems, engineering change workflows (ECR/ECO), and BOM/PLM structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication and interpersonal skills; the ability to influence and lead cross-functional teams without direct reporting authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to travel internationally as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to obtain and maintain an Australian Government Security Clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the defence, aerospace, maritime or other highly regulated industry, with a strong understanding of rigorous quality and documentation requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a first-of-type or prototype-to-rate production transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to multi-site or multi-jurisdiction manufacturing, including export-control and design-localisation considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with eBOM-to-mBOM release flow and manufacturing baseline definition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with international teams and navigating cultural differences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How These Roles Work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pooled, not program-dedicated.&lt;/strong&gt; Both seats are shared across Platform, Payload and Maritime Mission Systems, AUS and US, with coverage assigned by build-start date and load. As the team grows, focals will carry named programs across all production sites — starting a program up in AUS and following it through to US production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to&lt;/strong&gt; the NPI Program Manager, within the Production – New Product Introduction job family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an ----- address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is ----- before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fastly helps people stay better connected with the things they love. Fastly’s edge cloud platform enables customers to create great digital experiences quickly, securely, and reliably by processing, serving, and securing our customers’ applications as close to their end-users as possible — at the edge of the Internet. The platform is designed to take advantage of the modern internet, to be programmable, and to support agile software development. Fastly’s customers include many of the world’s most prominent companies, including GitHub, Yelp, Paramount, and JetBlue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building a more trustworthy Internet. Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fastly is looking for a Senior Enterprise Customer Success Manager to join our team in the UK. In this role, you will be a primary driver of our Customer Success Charter, maintaining a laser focus on renewals, retention, and expansion. You will serve as a trusted advisor to a portfolio of Enterprise customers, nurturing relationships from the C-suite down to technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for building high-value account strategies, driving product adoption, and mitigating risk to ensure long-term customer health. Success in this role is measured by your ability to deliver a &quot;net positive&quot; impact on our regional revenue and the measurable value we provide to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Account Planning &amp;amp; Strategy: Document and execute comprehensive strategy plans within your &quot;node.&quot; This includes relationship mapping, identifying revenue opportunities, and driving adoption of our sponsorship programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Account Expansion &amp;amp; Lead Gen: Expand executive reach through Executive Business Reviews (EBRs) and value-based reporting. You will map parent-subsidiary accounts to unlock new business units and drive deeper product integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Adoption: Ensure full adoption of existing and new product introductions by aligning Fastly’s solutions with specific customer priorities and pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Churn Prevention: Act as a trusted advisor to create &quot;sticky&quot; relationships. You will leverage executive relationships to nurture accounts at the decision-maker level and introduce product solutions that proactively close customer gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Renewals: Execute a &quot;give-to-get&quot; renewal strategy to achieve net-positive re-rate percentages. You will negotiate logo rights to enhance brand positioning and manage terms to ensure favorable outcomes for both Fastly and customers mainly across the e-commerce vertical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: Partner closely with Sales, Sales Engineering, and Marketing to provide the &quot;Voice of the Customer&quot; (VOC) feedback, ensuring our product roadmap aligns with regional needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: Proven Account Management and strategic Customer Success experience, ideally within the CDN, PaaS, or Cybersecurity industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Mindset: A track record of driving revenue through up-selling and cross-selling, with the ability to navigate complex &quot;parent-subsidiary&quot; account structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship Builder: Confident in managing C-level relationships and running high-impact customer meetings, workshops, and roundtables. This includes a proven track record of navigating complex Enterprise organizations to grow account relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Literacy: A technical background is highly valued; you should be able to align technical concepts with business value and customer goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Excellence: Highly organized with a strong attention to detail and strong project management skills. The individual will demonstrate the ability to work autonomously in a fast-paced, remote environment. A self starter mindset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: Exceptional verbal and written communication skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Success: Delight customers by demonstrating responsiveness and ensuring timely responses across account activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Work Hours &amp;amp; Location&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hours: Core business hours&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: This position is a hybrid role and open to candidates residing in the following locations: London&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel: Periodic travel across the UK and Europe is required to engage with customers in person.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fastly is an equal opportunity employer. We value diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Fastly?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have a huge impact.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fastly is a small company with a big reach. Not only do&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.fastly.com/customers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;our customers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;have a tremendous user base, but we also support a growing number of&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.fastly.com/open-source/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;open source projects and initiatives&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;Outside of code, employees are encouraged to share causes close to their heart with others so we can help lend a supportive hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We value diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Growing and maintaining our inclusive and diverse team matters to us. We are committed to being a company where our employees feel comfortable bringing their authentic selves to work and have the ability to be successful -- every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are passionate.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fastly is chock full of passionate people and we’re not ‘one size fits all’. Fastly employs authors, pilots, skiers, parents (of humans and animals), makeup geeks, coffee connoisseurs, and more. We love employees for who they are and what they are passionate about.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re always looking for humble, sharp, and creative folks to join the Fastly team. If you think you might be a fit please apply!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; A fully completed application and resume or CV are required when applying.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All job applications must be submitted through our official careers site at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fastly.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fastly.com/about/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. We will never request sensitive information, such as your Social Security number, bank account or credit card information during the application process. All official communication will come from an @&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://fastly.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;fastly.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; or @&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://recruiting.fastly.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;recruiting.fastly.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; email address. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fastly is committed to ensuring equal employment opportunity and to providing employees with a safe and welcoming work environment free of discrimination and harassment. Our employment decisions are based on business needs, job requirements and individual qualifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to age, ancestry, color, family or medical care leave, gender identity or expression, genetic information, marital status, medical condition, national origin, family or parental status, physical or mental disability, political affiliation, protected veteran status, race, religion, sex (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Consistent with the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) and federal or state disability laws, Fastly will provide reasonable accommodations for applicants and employees with disabilities. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please contact your Recruiter, or the Fastly Employee Relations team at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a ----- style=&quot;font-weight: ----- style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; or 501-287-4901.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fastly collects and processes personal data submitted by job applicants in accordance with our&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.fastly.com/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. Please see our&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.fastly.com/privacy-job-applicants&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;privacy notice for job applicants&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title:&lt;/strong&gt; Principal Engineer&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;London / Bristol / Edinburgh&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Enterprise Architecture&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; £120,000 - £160,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Director of Enterprise Architecture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based in London, Bristol or Edinburgh&amp;nbsp;and requires existing right to work in the UK.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;303&quot; data-local-id=&quot;71635837-a0ff-40e4-8b75-a1ff2b4444d0&quot;&gt;As a Principal Software Engineer at Kaluza, you will be the leading technical authority for a major global product area comprising multiple modules. You will lead innovation on some of the most complex, ambiguous, and large-scale solutions, aligning them with target architecture standards and contributing to the creation of a scalable platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;651&quot; data-local-id=&quot;afe318c5-d169-4335-980d-c55899c830d5&quot;&gt;You’ll have a broad sphere of influence, enabling multiple teams and serving as a strategic partner to our architecture leadership team and our community of principal and staff engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;840&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d1958d8-2004-4ea0-821c-a0ebcadb4a0e&quot;&gt;Your impact will come mostly from &#39;hands-off&#39; work; you’ll not be expected to write code day-to-day. But for some challenges, you may need to dive into code-level design or help build a proof-of-concept.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1072&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c232f15f-f0a4-4008-a7b5-f91f1cfafc20&quot;&gt;Architect modern distributed, cloud-based systems applying modern architecture and engineering practices in an enterprise software environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1219&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8dba6a70-6d5c-45e2-a3af-1ccdaa41a861&quot;&gt;Shape and influence technical vision and product roadmaps to align with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1310&quot; data-local-id=&quot;562ddf14-2519-461d-9844-e47621078721&quot;&gt;Provide hands-on leadership, making appropriate technical choices to satisfy requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7a0244ae-b45c-4845-88d4-50316da986b9&quot;&gt;Mentor and guide engineers in delivering autonomous, loosely coupled distributed systems with proven architectural principles and patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1547&quot; data-local-id=&quot;77346099-2aa3-43c1-91d9-749290fea5e1&quot;&gt;Lead technical due diligence and make high-stakes decisions with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1627&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7e1a1e9f-a262-4aec-8e83-9332f726304a&quot;&gt;Deliver results, influence diverse audiences, and orchestrate cross-functional solutions spanning multiple product features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1755&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c409df9a-e0b3-4f6b-a9a3-39d995612adf&quot;&gt;Engage effectively with both technical teams and executive leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1826&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7cb74d57-f395-456f-b7cf-298b271ed930&quot;&gt;Work independently and collaboratively, bringing strong opinions while respecting others, communicating openly, and maintaining self-awareness with a continuous growth mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2035&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a0dbc1d1-8544-470c-ae8a-18a2b9c5f141&quot;&gt;Experience enabling engineering teams to use AI and delivering AI/ML powered solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2126&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4e471dc5-7261-4e8c-ad4b-265e11f79d54&quot;&gt;Demonstrable experience in architecting solutions in complex business domains, particularly interface design and data modelling, ideally with experience in AWS and API design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2305&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d87f974-8329-4a1b-9b26-2dfa45af34f8&quot;&gt;Proven track record delivering global &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;B2B2C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; SaaS (energy or other mission‑critical industries).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;769f5e5e-483c-4ef8-ba0e-ff433059a8a0&quot;&gt;Success driving adoption of modern engineering practices (e.g. DevOps, CI/CD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2486&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d6312d22-3a41-4bcc-837e-9eee49ca8fda&quot;&gt;Experience leading teams through significant changes in ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2562&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f6f5546f-363b-4985-91fd-d58666e49784&quot;&gt;Ability to ramp up rapidly in new domains and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business: Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund - to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Leave Policy - With no qualifying service periods, including 26 weeks full pay if you have a new addition to your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Learning Budget - Upskill, learn and grow!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Budget&lt;br&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Find out more about working in&lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com/&quot;&gt; Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Join a team of passionate and committed people working to improve healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, our tech teams build products and features that improve the daily lives of healthcare professionals and patients. We work in feature teams within an agile environment, in close collaboration with Product, Design, Data Science, and Business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Tech team and contribute to the development of AI-powered features at Doctolib.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with experienced AI and software engineers to explore, prototype, evaluate, and improve AI-based solutions. This internship will give you the opportunity to gain practical experience across the different stages of an AI product, from experimentation to integration into a production environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of AI features and services under the guidance of experienced engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write Python code to support prototypes, experiments, evaluation tools, and backend components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with large language models, prompting techniques, retrieval, and tool integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to automated tests and documentation for the components you develop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate issues, analyse results, and suggest improvements to your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews, technical discussions, and team rituals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will receive regular guidance from your mentor and teammates. The scope of your work will grow progressively as you become familiar with the codebase, the tools, and the technical challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on, if you do not have the exact profile described below but feel that this internship matches your skills and interests, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a great fit if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are in the final year of a degree in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Software Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have basic experience with Python through coursework, personal projects, research, or previous internships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a basic understanding of programming concepts, data structures, and software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about artificial intelligence and interested in understanding how AI systems work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable communicating in English, both written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on a project involving machine learning, natural language processing, or large language models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have used agentic frameworks like Langchain or Google ADK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experimented with AI APIs, prompting, retrieval, or conversational interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in taking products to production and supporting them with real users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have some experience with Git, APIs, testing, or data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an interest in healthcare, privacy, or responsible AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our products are built on a cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile applications across several countries and healthcare systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even if Doctolib uses technologies like Ruby on Rails, TypeScript, Java, Kotlin, Swift, React Native, and many cloud-related technologies, the principal language you&#39;ll work on is Python.You will also have the opportunity to use AI-assisted development tools within our engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover our AI vision&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; and learn more about our tech culture on the&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt; Doctolib Tech site&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured internship with dedicated mentoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work on real AI projects in a healthcare environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical learning sessions and access to internal engineering communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to AI tools for coding, development, and learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 2 days of remote work per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible workplace policy, depending on the team and location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and international working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship, 6 months, full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Berlin, Paris, Nantes, Milan, or Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup, up to 2 remote days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: March 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. We evaluate candidates based on their qualifications, motivation, and potential, without discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the better our products can serve patients and healthcare professionals. We welcome applications regardless of gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability, or place of origin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support an inclusive recruitment process, we invite you to leave personal information such as pictures and age off your application. If you require an accommodation during the interview process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All information provided through this application is processed by Doctolib for recruitment purposes. For more information about how Doctolib processes your application data, please consult the relevant privacy policy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt;Germany&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt;France&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot;&gt;Italy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot;&gt;The Netherlands&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For questions or to exercise your rights, please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)&lt;a href=&quot;http://doctolib.com/&quot;&gt;doctolib.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt; About the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of Legal supports Alma to grow safely and sustainably by anticipating and managing legal risk, providing pragmatic advice, negotiating contracts, and supporting teams across the company; in a strongly regulated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of Legal&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;reports to Alma’s General Secretary and lead the Legal function. You will be a trusted partner to the Director’s Committee and work closely with Product, Tech, Sales, Operations, Finance, Risk, Compliance, Information Security and People.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also act as Alma’s Data Protection Officer, with the independence, resources and direct access to senior management required to perform the role effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a permanent position based in Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Legal, you will define Alma’s legal and privacy strategy and ensure that it supports the company’s business ambitions, regulatory obligations and risk appetite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your main responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and lead Alma’s legal strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a clear legal roadmap aligned with Alma’s business and international strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, assess and manage Alma’s main legal risks, escalating material matters to executive management and governance bodies when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear, pragmatic and business-oriented advice to the Executive Committee and teams across Alma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex legal requirements into actionable recommendations, policies and scalable operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor relevant legal developments across Alma’s markets and anticipate their impact on the company’s products and activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Alma’s business, products and partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Product and Tech teams throughout the design and launch of new products and features, embedding legal and privacy considerations from the outset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Sales, Account Management, Operations and other business teams on strategic projects and complex legal questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the drafting, review and negotiation of commercial agreements, including agreements with merchants, partners, suppliers and technology providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish scalable contracting standards, templates, playbooks and approval processes that enable teams to move quickly while controlling legal risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on strategic transactions, partnerships, outsourcing arrangements and international expansion projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee corporate and governance matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Alma’s corporate legal matters and ensure that its legal entities comply with applicable governance and corporate requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support executive management and governance bodies in preparing decisions and maintaining appropriate corporate documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on financing, corporate transactions, intellectual property, competition law and other strategic legal matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate external counsel and manage the legal budget, ensuring that external expertise is used effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee litigation, pre-litigation, claims and other disputes, defining the appropriate strategy and protecting Alma’s interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as Alma’s Data Protection Officer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and oversee Alma’s data protection framework in accordance with the GDPR and other applicable privacy laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform and advise Alma and its employees on their data protection obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor compliance through appropriate policies, processes, controls and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and continuously improve Alma’s privacy governance, including records of processing activities, privacy notices, retention standards and procedures for handling data-subject requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a robust framework for data protection impact assessments and ensure that DPIAs are conducted when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Product, Tech, Data, Risk, Operations, Marketing and People teams on privacy-by-design and privacy-by-default principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Information Security on personal-data breaches, incident response, security measures and regulatory notifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as Alma’s primary contact for data protection authorities and cooperate with them when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop training and awareness initiatives to foster a strong data protection culture throughout Alma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the Legal team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a clear vision, priorities and operating model for the Legal team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach and develop team members, promoting high standards of expertise, ownership and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allocate resources according to business priorities and ensure that legal requests are handled effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define meaningful objectives and indicators to measure the team’s impact, service quality and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships across Alma and position Legal as both a strategic partner and an independent control function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You combine excellent legal judgment with a strong understanding of business. You are comfortable taking clear positions on complex matters while remaining pragmatic and solution-oriented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are likely to thrive in this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can move comfortably between strategic questions and hands-on legal work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand how to balance business velocity, customer experience, innovation and legal risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex legal matters clearly to both legal and non-legal audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior leaders and challenge decisions constructively when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy developing people and creating clarity for a multidisciplinary team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working with incomplete information and taking ownership of sensitive or high-impact decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong negotiation, drafting and stakeholder-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in both French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a Master’s degree in law or an equivalent legal qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant experience in senior legal positions (15+ years), combining experience in a leading bank or FinTech and a law firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong expertise in banking, commercial and technology contracts, corporate matters and business law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international activities and working across several European jurisdictions would also be valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the level of expertise and professional standing required to act as Data Protection Officer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Hiring process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because of the strategic importance of this role, the recruitment process will be thorough while remaining as efficient as possible. It is expected to include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An introductory conversation with the Talent Acquisition team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interview with the General Secretary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical case study focused on legal strategy, business partnering and data protection with key members of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meetings with key members of Alma’s leadership and relevant cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interview with one of our co-founders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Precision for Medicine, Oncology and Rare Disease is not your typical CRO. We are passionate about cultivating our culture and are proud to share extremely high CRA retention rates compared to industry averages. We are now recruiting &lt;strong&gt;Clinical Research Associates (different seniority levels) &lt;/strong&gt;to join our team in Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CRAs join us, love their jobs, and stay because of the amazing people and enjoyable quality of life. You will focus on an average of one to two studies setting you up to be a protocol expert. Travel is reasonable and your work/life balance will benefit as a result. Most meaningfully - your voice will be heard. Working in a smaller CRO allows you to have influence and impact when it matters most and support from direct line management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are calm, thoughtful, and responsive when things don’t go as planned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are well-prepared, whether it be for an investigator meeting, site visit or project team update, always staying two steps ahead of the game.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You find quick and creative ways of overcoming difficulties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an impeccable eye for detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You identify potential study risks and propose solutions on how to mitigate them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take responsibility in the quality and outcomes of your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are adept at handling conflict by using tried and true resolution strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we will keep you busy and support your growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will monitor and own the progress of clinical studies at investigative sites and ensure that clinical studies are conducted, recorded, and reported per protocol, SOPs, ICH-GCP, and all applicable regulations and standards. You will coordinate all necessary activities required to set up and monitor a study (i.e., identify investigators; helping prepare regulatory submissions, conducting pre-study and initiation visits, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Minimum Required&lt;/u&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate or postgraduate degree with a concentration in a scientific or healthcare discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 6 months of experience as a CRA in either a CRO or pharmaceutical/biotech industry or equivalent, relevant experience and/or demonstrated competencies. Site management or equivalent experience in clinical research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Other Required&lt;/u&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and organizational skills are essential. A team player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of a client focused approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability for domestic travel including overnight stays, which may constitute up to approximately 50-60% travel commitment (international travel may be required for some senior level positions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in oncology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Preferred&lt;/u&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Study start up activities experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CAR-T or FIH - phase III&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical device experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-EK1 #LI-Remote &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please, apply in English.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Precision for Medicine, Oncology &amp;amp; Rare Disease is a precision medicine CRO. Precision’s uniquely integrated offering enables the science of precision medicine by combining novel clinical trial designs, industry-leading operational and medical experts, advanced biomarker and data analytics solutions, and an unequivocal real passion for rare diseases and oncology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Precision medicine is revolutionizing the attack on cancer—and we are passionate about helping you harness its power. We strike tumors on a molecular level using biomarkers to link specific mutations to specific treatments. We combine deep science with deep data from advanced technological platforms, then layer on specialized expertise in the design and execution of targeted, adaptive clinical trials. Ultimately, we deliver robust insights that inform real-time decisions—and optimize the oncology development pathway.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invite you to learn more about our growing organization serving our clients that are researching groundbreaking cancer therapies. We strive to ensure employees feel appreciated for the contributions they make every single day. You will provide input and have your ideas valued and nurtured, impacting positive change for the company.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
